msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oh!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡Ah!）」"

msgid "???「......」"
msgstr "???「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wh...... What? Do I know her? Is she＿looking at me?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qu...... Qué? ¿La conozco?＿¿Me está mirando a mí?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh...... She left...... I guess I didn't know＿her......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah...... Se fue...... Supongo＿que no la conocía......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I gotta say, she was incredibly＿beautiful. So pretty, a person could fall＿in love just looking at her......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Debo admitir que era bellísima.＿Tan linda que uno podría enamorarse＿con solo mirarla......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is she a model or something?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Será modelo o algo así?）」"

msgid "???「Excuse you!」"
msgstr "???「¡Oye, más respeto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ohh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ehh?!」"

msgid "???「Why are you ignoring me?」"
msgstr "???「¿Por qué me ignoras?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Err... W-What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm... ¿A-A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "???「I mean what I said, Takasu-kun. I don't＿get why you're ignoring me!」"
msgstr "???「A lo que dije, Takasu-kun. ¡No＿entiendo por qué me ignoras!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's just, since you didn't say anything, I＿thought......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es solo que, como no dijiste＿nada, pensé......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I never would have guessed that I＿knew this girl......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Jamás habría imaginado que conocía＿a esta chica......）」"

msgid "???「......You thought what?」"
msgstr "???「......¿Pensaste qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Is that Ami-chan? Oh my god, it's really＿her～!」"
msgstr "Estudiante「¿Esa es Ami-chan? ¡Dios mío,＿de verdad es ella～!」"

msgid "Ami「Oh...... Ufu♪」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah...... Ufu♪」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Hey Ami-chan, can I have your＿autograph～? I've got that magazine＿with you on the cover～ Please sign it!」"
msgstr "Estudiante「Oye, Ami-chan, ¿me das tu autógrafo～?＿Tengo esa revista en la que sales en＿portada～ ¡Fírmala, por favor!」"

msgid "Ami「What～? Like, you really want an＿autograph from little old me? Aww, I'm＿like, SO happy～ ① Give me a second......」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué～? O sea, ¿de verdad quieres un＿autógrafo mío? Ay, o sea, ¡estoy SÚPER＿feliz～! ① Dame un segundo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So she's a model for fashion＿magazines, no surprise there......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Así que es modelo de revistas de＿moda, no me sorprende......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But she wrote her name \"Kawashima＿Ami\" in print. If it's an autograph......＿shouldn't it at least be in cursive?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero escribió \"Kawashima Ami\" en letra＿de imprenta. Si es un autógrafo......＿¿no debería ir al menos en cursiva?）」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Wow～ Thank you～!」"
msgstr "Estudiante「¡Guau～ Muchas gracias～!」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「......! Hey, that guy with Ami-chan is kind＿of scary.」"
msgstr "Estudiante「¡......! Oye, ese chico que está con＿Ami-chan da un poco de miedo.」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「......Aah!」"
msgstr "Estudiante「......¡Aah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... I, uh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Y-Yo, eh......」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, this is my classmate. We bumped＿into each other just now～」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, él es mi compañero de clase. Nos＿acabamos de encontrar por casualidad～」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Oh, I see. Hmm, that makes sense. He＿doesn't seem like your boyfriend.」"
msgstr "Estudiante「Ah, ya veo. Mmm, tiene sentido.＿No parece ser tu novio.」"

msgid "Ami「True, he's not my boyfriend, but like......＿don't you think that was rude～?」"
msgstr "Ami「No es mi novio, pero, o sea......＿¿no crees que fue grosero～?」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Huh? Oh, gosh...... I'm sorry!」"
msgstr "Estudiante「¿Eh? Ay, cielos...... ¡Lo siento!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh...... it's fine, really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah...... no pasa nada, de verdad.」"

msgid "Ami「Sorry about that～」"
msgstr "Ami「Perdona por eso～」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「You don't have to apologize,＿Ami-chan～ It was my fault.」"
msgstr "Estudiante「No tienes por qué disculparte,＿Ami-chan～ Fue culpa mía.」"

msgid "Schoolgirl「Sorry, Ami-chan. See ya～」"
msgstr "Estudiante「Perdón, Ami-chan. Nos vemos～」"

msgid "Ami「You bet～! See you around!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Claro～! ¡Nos vemos luego!」"

msgid "Ami「......Good grief. It's hard work being an＿idol.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Por Dios. Qué difícil＿es ser una ídolo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Umm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm......」"

msgid "Ami「......What?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Um, I just wanted to say... Thank you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, solo quería decirte... Gracias.」"

msgid "Ami「It's nothing. I didn't do it to earn your＿gratitude.」"
msgstr "Ami「No es nada. No lo hice para＿ganarme tu gratitud.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「You know, today you've been kind of......＿Nah, forget it. I gotta go.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sabes, hoy has estado un poco......＿Bah, olvídalo. Me tengo que ir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Oh, er, alright!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¡Ah, ehm, está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kawashima Ami...... She said she's my＿classmate......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kawashima Ami...... Dijo que es＿mi compañera de clase......）」"
